%% Chat and notifications
%% Status: current | Related: docs/blueprint/workflows/chat_flow.mmd
flowchart TB
  subgraph Chat
    List[GET /api/chat conversations] --> Open[Open conversation]
    Open --> Send[POST message]
    Send --> Meter[checkAndIncrementUsage chats_per_day]
    Meter --> Store[Persist message]
    Store --> Push[Notify other party]
  end

  subgraph Notifications
    Prefs[notification_preferences] --> Channels{Plan notifications feature}
    Channels --> Email[email]
    Channels --> WhatsApp[whatsapp tiers]
    Channels --> Webhook[Platinum catalog: webhook — catalog-only]
    InApp[/api/notifications in-app feed]
  end

  Push --> InApp
